    "title": "Man arrested at Lil Wayne concert at Darien Lake - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Darien\nMan arrested at Lil Wayne concert at Darien Lake\n32 minutes ago\nDARIEN, N.Y. — Police made one arrest at the Lil Wayne concert at the Darien Lake Amphitheater last Saturday. A 32-year-old man from the Bronx, NY was arrested after allegedly attempting to enter the concert without having a ticket. He was then advised to leave the property by Live Nation employees. The man refused to leave the venue after being asked to leave by sheriff's deputies, according to the Genesee County Sheriff's Office. He was transported to the Genesee County Jail for processing.",
